{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffFhbrzmyqqNVcub9yMf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the repaired candidate, and the self-check prints **OK**. It hasn't been through the novelty gate yet; the check command doesn't run that.\n\n**What failed before:** the previous attempt was effectively the same model as `streak_aware_balanced_alternation_ideal`. It added the same longest-streak penalty to the same incumbent, so the two made identical predictions (RMSE 0.00000 on the novelty pool).\n\n**What I changed:** the model is `triplet_variety_balanced_alternation_ideal`, a refinement of the incumbent `balance_aware_heads_alternation_ideal`. It keeps everything in the incumbent: each person's ideal switching rate with length-scaled sensitivity, the penalty for periodic sequences, the heads lean and the H/T balance penalty. The one change is a shared reward, `rho`, for local pattern variety. A sequence scores higher the larger the share of its overlapping three-flip chunks that differ from each other (out of `min(8, length − 2)` possible chunks; 0 for length 2). This targets the critique's FDR-surviving finding (q = 0.008): when two sequences switch equally often, people pick the one with more distinct triplets far more often than the incumbent predicts. No live model uses this cue, so it should clear the novelty gate, though I couldn't test that.\n\n**Self-check result:** the short smoke fit (100 draws, 1 chain) gave ELPD-LOO −2379.7, against the incumbent's −2383.0. That fit is too small to read as an improvement. It also gave two warnings:\n- R-hat isn't available from a single chain, so convergence is still unchecked until admission's full fit.\n- PSIS-LOO is flagged unreliable: 7.2% of trials have Pareto k above 0.5, against a 1% tolerance. This may just be the short fit; admission's full fit will show whether it holds.\n\nThe files are in `iter_1/candidate_4_repair_1/`: `hypothesis.md`, `model_name.txt` and `candidate.py`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2470,"cache_read_input_tokens":67900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2470,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f54b17c-fa34-4aae-9717-d0a890cb62c8","uuid":"06c1c062-bce9-4213-8c03-dafb63c163ec","timestamp":"2026-10-03T11:50:55.786Z","request_id":"req_011CffFhaqz11skrs3DqmxUX"}
